commit aed9a9b1ed3abd4c34b45e0d0adff0386c0e2fb8
Author: wormzjl <wormzjl@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Sep 25 04:05:52 2026 +0800

    Start an unsaturated gas's partial pressure at its fixed point (P3 WP7b)
    
    FluidTpEquilibrium.solveWet tries up to three fixed-point steps
    pc = P - n_w R T / V_gas(pc) before the bisection, started from the
    saturated split's gas scaled to the root, each accepted only on the
    bisection's own stop test; the bisection stays the fallback. The pumped
    six-tank start's first 0.05 s slice falls from 214,660 to 36,961
    checkpoints (the test rig's first 100-tick slice from 958,039 to
    177,479), same substeps and end states.
    
    The four phase tests that used 3 MPa (or 6 MPa nitrogen) as the network's
    out-of-domain example now refuse at 12 MPa and assert the old examples
    answered; the pure-nitrogen UV coexistence temperature is held to 1e-10
    (the search's step tolerance is 1e-11 T; the 10 MPa window's path stops
    7.6e-12 T short), PH keeps 1e-12.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

